        "description": {
            "value": "<p>The six paths of transmigration, all at once, to everyone in reach.</p><p>Each enemy in the emanation must attempt a Will save.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature loses <strong>all five senses</strong> for 1 minute. While senseless it is blinded, deafened, off-guard, and takes a &minus;4 status penalty to attack rolls, skill checks, and Perception.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but until it receives a <em>restoration</em> ritual.</p><hr /><p>Granted by the Virgo Zenith Boon, once per minute.</p>"
